            "review_title": "Review at 2cents",
            "review_text": "TerryChefman\n2 contributions\n0\nGreat find in the old quarter!\nJul 2019 • Solo\nWalking through the labyrinth of streets in the Old Quarter, I came across 2 Cents. I needed something quick to keep me going until the late evening. The Banh Mi was delicious, the food preparation was clean and hygienic. It stood out from the rest of the food stalls in the street. After speaking to the owner, who served me they have only been operating a very short time, in fact she's still at university studying and started this enterprise with her best friend. They were most hospitable and courteous to all the customers when I was there. Highly recommend a visit when you are in the Old Quarter.\nRead more\nWritten July 12, 2019",
